            </h1>

            <p class="section-copy hero-text">
              J Arts 360 View creates polished photography, cinematic video,
              drone coverage, and immersive 3D tours that help agents, builders,
              and homeowners present every property with confidence.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a href="#book" class="primary-btn">Book a Shoot</a>
              <a href="#portfolio" class="secondary-btn">View Portfolio</a>
            </div>

            <div class="metric-row">
              <div class="metric-pill">Photography</div>
              <div class="metric-pill">Drone</div>
              <div class="metric-pill">Video Walkthroughs</div>
              <div class="metric-pill">3D Tours</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-media glass-card">
            {heroBg && (
              <Image
                src={heroBg}
                alt="Featured luxury property"
                class="hero-image"
                loading="eager"
                fetchpriority="high"
              />
            )}
            <div class="hero-overlay-card">
              <p>Trusted visual presentation for modern real estate listings.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section class="trust-strip">
        <div class="section-shell trust-grid glass-card">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Fast Turnaround</p>
            <p class="section-copy">
              Edited media delivered quickly so listings can go live without
              delay.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">MLS Ready</p>
            <p class="section-copy">
              Assets prepared for listing platforms, websites, and social media.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Premium Finish</p>
            <p class="section-copy">
              Lighting, composition, and editing designed to elevate each space.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="services" class="section-pad">
        <div class="section-shell">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Services</p>
              <h2 class="section-title">Media packages built for serious listings.</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-copy section-heading-copy">
              Every package is designed to help properties look sharper, feel
              more valuable, and attract more attention from buyers.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="services-grid">
            <div class="service-card">
              <h3>Listing Photography</h3>
              <p>
                Interior and exterior photography with balanced lighting,
                natural color, and MLS-ready delivery.
              </p>
              <p class="service-price">From $120 <span>+ HST</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h3>Cinematic Video</h3>
              <p>
                Walkthrough video that highlights flow, scale, and the strongest
                selling features of the property.
              </p>
              <p class="service-price">From $150 <span>+ HST</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h3>Drone Aerial</h3>
              <p>
                Elevated perspectives that show frontage, lot shape,
                neighborhood context, and surrounding appeal.
              </p>
              <p class="service-price">From $99 <span>+ HST</span></p>
            </div>

            <div class="service-card">
              <h3>3D Virtual Tours</h3>
              <p>
                Immersive tours that allow buyers to explore spaces remotely and
                understand the layout more clearly.
              </p>
              <p class="service-price">From $200 <span>+ HST</span></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="portfolio" class="section-pad portfolio-section">
        <div class="section-shell">
          <div class="section-heading portfolio-head">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Portfolio</p>
              <h2 class="section-title">Selected property visuals.</h2>
            </div>

            <div class="filter-row" id="filter-controls">
              <button class="filter-btn active" data-filter="all">All</button>
              <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="interior">Interiors</button>
              <button class="filter-btn" data-filter="aerial">Aerials</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="gallery-grid" id="gallery-grid">
            {initialGallery.map((item) => (
              <button
                class="gallery-item lightbox-trigger"
                data-category={item.category}
                data-highres={item.image.src}
                aria-label={`Open ${item.category} image`}
              >
                <Image
                  src={item.image}
                  alt={`J Arts 360 View ${item.category} work`}
                  class="gallery-image"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
              </button>
            ))}

            {extendedGallery.map((item) => (
              <button
                class="gallery-item lightbox-trigger extra-image hidden"
                data-category={item.category}
                data-highres={item.image.src}
                aria-label={`Open ${item.category} image`}
              >
                <Image
                  src={item.image}
                  alt={`J Arts 360 View ${item.category} work`}
                  class="gallery-image"
                  loading="lazy"
                />
              </button>
            ))}
          </div>

          {extendedGallery.length > 0 && (
            <div class="load-more-wrap" id="load-more-container">
              <button id="load-more-btn" class="secondary-btn">Load More</button>
            </div>
          )}
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="testimonials" class="section-pad">
        <div class="section-shell">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Client Reviews</p>
              <h2 class="section-title">Proof that presentation matters.</h2>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="reviews-grid">
            <div class="quote-card">
              <p>
                "Beautifully clicked the pictures. Professional, prompt &
                friendly service."
              </p>
              <strong>Monika Bansal</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="quote-card">
              <p>
                "Photos they produced were absolutely stunning. Commitment to
                customer satisfaction is truly impressive."
              </p>
              <strong>Sushaant Dhamijaa</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="quote-card">
              <p>
                "Consistently delivers outstanding results. Communication and
                scheduling support have been excellent."
              </p>
              <strong>Benson Crew</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="book" class="section-pad booking-section">
        <div class="section-shell booking-layout">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">Book a Shoot</p>
            <h2 class="section-title">Ready to elevate your next listing?</h2>
            <p class="section-copy booking-copy">
              Choose the right media package and reserve your preferred date.
              You can also reach out directly using the details below.
            </p>

            <div class="contact-stack">
              <div class="contact-item">
                <span>T</span>
                <a href="tel:6477103982">647 710 3982</a>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-item">
                <span>E</span>
                <a href="mailto:jartsguelph@gmail.com">jartsguelph@gmail.com</a>
              </div>
              <div class="contact-item">
                <span>HQ</span>
                <span>63 Candlewood Drive, Guelph</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="booking-panel">
            <div class="booking-placeholder">
              Cal.com embed goes here
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <p>© 2026 J Arts 360 View. Premium real estate visual storytelling.</p>
    </footer>

    <div id="lightbox-modal" class="lightbox-modal hidden" aria-hidden="true">
      <button id="lightbox-close" class="lightbox-close" aria-label="Close image viewer">
        ✕
      </button>
      <img id="lightbox-image" src="" alt="Expanded gallery image" class="lightbox-image" />
    </div>

    <script>
      document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
        const filterBtns = document.querySelectorAll('.filter-btn');
        const galleryItems = document.querySelectorAll('.gallery-item');
        const loadMoreContainer = document.getElementById('load-more-container');
        const loadMoreBtn = document.getElementById('load-more-btn');

        let currentFilter = 'all';

        filterBtns.forEach((btn) => {
          btn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
            filterBtns.forEach((b) => b.classList.remove('active'));
            const target = e.currentTarget;
            target.classList.add('active');
            currentFilter = target.getAttribute('data-filter') || 'all';

            galleryItems.forEach((item) => {
              const itemCategory = item.getAttribute('data-category');
              const isExtra = item.classList.contains('extra-image');
              const shouldShow = currentFilter === 'all' || currentFilter === itemCategory;

              if (shouldShow && !isExtra) {
                item.classList.remove('hidden');
              } else {
                item.classList.add('hidden');
              }
            });

            if (loadMoreContainer) {
              loadMoreContainer.style.display = currentFilter === 'all' ? 'flex' : 'none';
            }
          });
        });

        if (loadMoreBtn) {
          loadMoreBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
            galleryItems.forEach((item) => {
              const itemCategory = item.getAttribute('data-category');
              item.classList.remove('extra-image');

              if (currentFilter === 'all' || currentFilter === itemCategory) {
                item.classList.remove('hidden');
              }
            });

            if (loadMoreContainer) {
              loadMoreContainer.remove();
            }
          });
        }

        const modal = document.getElementById('lightbox-modal');
        const modalImage = document.getElementById('lightbox-image');
        const closeBtn = document.getElementById('lightbox-close');
        const triggers = document.querySelectorAll('.lightbox-trigger');

        const closeModal = () => {
          modal?.classList.add('hidden');
          if (modalImage) modalImage.setAttribute('src', '');
          document.body.style.overflow = 'auto';
        };

        triggers.forEach((trigger) => {
          trigger.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const highResSource = trigger.getAttribute('data-highres');
            if (modalImage && highResSource) {
              modalImage.setAttribute('src', highResSource);
            }
            modal?.classList.remove('hidden');
            document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
          });
        });

        closeBtn?.addEventListener('click', closeModal);

        modal?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          if (e.target === modal) {
            closeModal();
          }
        });

        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
          if (e.key === 'Escape') {
            closeModal();
          }
        });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>